<b>Hold it, no one leaves without a <color=\#c30010>MAP</color>.</b> He stands firm, hands resting on the hilt of his sheathed sword. His posture is straight, disciplined, but his voice is calm rather than aggressive.<b> Rules are rules.</b>
<b> You can ask Judy for one, but first go and speak with Sofia if you haven't already, she is waiting for you.</b>
